The film stars Sam Rockwell, Vera Farmiga and Jacob Kogan.

12
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
Joshua premiered at the 2007 Sundance Film Festival and was released on July
6, 2007, in the United States by Fox Searchlight Pictures.

13
